# No fade transitions

Do not add fade-in, fade-out, opacity transitions, entrance/exit animations, loading animations, or cinematic page transitions unless the user explicitly asks for them.

Clicking a control should change the UI immediately, like a traditional website.

```css
/* BAD — do not do this unless asked */
#construction {
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.35s ease;
}
```

```css
/* GOOD — show or hide at once */
html.entered #construction {
  display: none;
}
```
